# Normalize line endings: store LF in repo, checkout appropriate for OS.
# This prevents Windows CRLF from causing test failures on DCC (Linux).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files — no line-ending conversion
# Note: *.csv is intentionally NOT listed here.
# Test fixture CSVs (tests/fixtures/) are small text files — keeping them as
# text allows readable diffs. The large IRB data CSVs are excluded by .gitignore.
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
